{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Alert message is a UI element that displays system feedback, status changes or required action; throughout detailed, prominent, persistent and actionable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"communication. Alert message includes functional icon and semantic colour, and may include as well a close button and\/or action link.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Alert Message does not disappear automatically and remains visible until dismissed or resolved by the user.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage\/Link"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage\/init(_:tableName:bundle:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-1hv9b","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage\/init(_:tableName:bundle:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-22xia","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage\/init(_:tableName:bundle:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-9qlvt","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage\/init(_:tableName:bundle:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-ums4","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage\/init(label:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-2k8o2","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage\/init(label:status:description:bulletL